{"n":33,"date":"1920-07-23","public":false,"pdf_start":697,"pdf_end":698,"title_fr":"33IÈME SÉANCE (non-publique), tenue au Palais de la Paix, à La Haye, le 23 juillet 1920.","title_en":"33RD MEETING (Private), held at the Peace Palace, the Hague, on July 23rd, 1920.","id":"33","annexes":[],"n_segments":11,"segments":[{"id":"s0697.01","meeting":33,"doc":"minutes","annex_id":null,"pdf_from":697,"pdf_to":697,"printed_from":687,"ord":5633,"layout":"bilingual","kind":"text","row_type":"pair","fr_html":"<p>33<sup>IÈME</sup> SÉANCE (non-publique),  <br>tenue au Palais de la Paix, à La Haye,  <br>le 23 juillet 1920.</p>","en_html":"<p>33<sup>RD</sup> MEETING (Private),  <br>held at the Peace Palace, the Hague,  <br>on July 23<sup>rd</sup>, 1920.</p>","full_html":"","fr_text":"33 SÉANCE (non-publique), tenue au Palais de la Paix, à La Haye, le 23 juillet 1920.","en_text":"33 MEETING (Private), held at the Peace Palace, the Hague, on July 23, 1920.","full_text":"","bbox_fr":[0.0573,0.1524,0.4611,0.2075],"bbox_en":[0.5228,0.1524,0.906,0.2075],"bbox_full":null,"notes":[],"merged_ids":[],"page_markers":[{"pdf":697,"printed":687}],"text_sha":"c7e02d1b80e9570d6f0f45fac25877eaeafb31fed0c6e715576c1d6b7e518aae","lang":"both","section":"m33","ord_in_meeting":1,"text_id":null,"parts":[{"pdf":697}],"align_flag":null,"note_details":[]},{"id":"s0697.02","meeting":33,"doc":"minutes","annex_id":null,"pdf_from":697,"pdf_to":697,"printed_from":687,"ord":5634,"layout":"bilingual","kind":"text","row_type":"pair","fr_html":"<p>Présidence de M. le BARON DESCAMPS.</p>","en_html":"<p>BARON DESCAMPS in the chair.</p>","full_html":"","fr_text":"Présidence de M. le BARON DESCAMPS.","en_text":"BARON DESCAMPS in the chair.","full_text":"","bbox_fr":[0.0543,0.2419,0.4699,0.2596],"bbox_en":[0.514,0.2419,0.8414,0.2596],"bbox_full":null,"notes":[],"merged_ids":[],"page_markers":[{"pdf":697,"printed":687}],"text_sha":"2b402638938303147733087edd5a00c26bfb964803b3f203e2d6a76aa138b5eb","lang":"both","section":"m33","ord_in_meeting":2,"text_id":null,"parts":[{"pdf":697}],"align_flag":null,"note_details":[]},{"id":"s0697.03","meeting":33,"doc":"minutes","annex_id":null,"pdf_from":697,"pdf_to":697,"printed_from":687,"ord":5635,"layout":"bilingual","kind":"text","row_type":"pair","fr_html":"<p>Sont présents: tous les membres du Comité (à l'exception de M. Bevilaqua); M. Fernandes; Mr. James Brown Scott; les secrétaires particuliers du Baron Descamps et de M. Adatci; les membres du Secrétariat.</p>","en_html":"<p>Present: all members of the Committee (with the exception of M. Bevilaqua); M. Fernandes, Mr. James Brown Scott; the private secretaries of Baron Descamps and of M. Adatci; the members of the Secretariat.</p>","full_html":"","fr_text":"Sont présents: tous les membres du Comité (à l'exception de M. Bevilaqua); M. Fernandes; Mr. James Brown Scott; les secrétaires particuliers du Baron Descamps et de M. Adatci; les membres du Secrétariat.","en_text":"Present: all members of the Committee (with the exception of M. Bevilaqua); M. Fernandes, Mr. James Brown Scott; the private secretaries of Baron Descamps and of M. Adatci; the members of the Secretariat.","full_text":"","bbox_fr":[0.0352,0.2645,0.4831,0.3392],"bbox_en":[0.4949,0.2645,0.9354,0.3392],"bbox_full":null,"notes":[],"merged_ids":[],"page_markers":[{"pdf":697,"printed":687}],"text_sha":"13c0dec43c902faccbb796671d553d2e2b42b9d40233a2103b1b3e42eedf52f1","lang":"both","section":"m33","ord_in_meeting":3,"text_id":null,"parts":[{"pdf":697}],"align_flag":null,"note_details":[]},{"id":"s0697.04","meeting":33,"doc":"minutes","annex_id":null,"pdf_from":697,"pdf_to":697,"printed_from":687,"ord":5636,"layout":"bilingual","kind":"text","row_type":"pair","fr_html":"<p>La séance est ouverte à 3.30 heures de l'après-midi.</p>","en_html":"<p>The meeting opened at 3.30 p.m.</p>","full_html":"","fr_text":"La séance est ouverte à 3.30 heures de l'après-midi.","en_text":"The meeting opened at 3.30 p.m.","full_text":"","bbox_fr":[0.0352,0.3373,0.4831,0.3677],"bbox_en":[0.514,0.3373,0.8355,0.354],"bbox_full":null,"notes":[],"merged_ids":[],"page_markers":[{"pdf":697,"printed":687}],"text_sha":"3dc810b229c465aec0dad67bf60451062d3ec7b4b919d3c7b4576a6552833472","lang":"both","section":"m33","ord_in_meeting":4,"text_id":null,"parts":[{"pdf":697}],"align_flag":null,"note_details":[]},{"id":"s0697.05","meeting":33,"doc":"minutes","annex_id":null,"pdf_from":697,"pdf_to":697,"printed_from":687,"ord":5637,"layout":"bilingual","kind":"text","row_type":"pair","fr_html":"<p>Le PRESIDENT invite M. de Lapradelle à continuer la lecture de son rapport.</p>","en_html":"<p>The PRESIDENT asked M. de Lapradelle to continue the reading of his report.</p>","full_html":"","fr_text":"Le PRESIDENT invite M. de Lapradelle à continuer la lecture de son rapport.","en_text":"The PRESIDENT asked M. de Lapradelle to continue the reading of his report.","full_text":"","bbox_fr":[0.0352,0.3736,0.4831,0.4041],"bbox_en":[0.4949,0.3736,0.9354,0.4041],"bbox_full":null,"notes":[],"merged_ids":[],"page_markers":[{"pdf":697,"printed":687}],"text_sha":"ad45d1bbab21b57b68e575aa0696995ef1d35827eceb128172a46cba4a0bca0f","lang":"both","section":"m33","ord_in_meeting":5,"text_id":null,"parts":[{"pdf":697}],"align_flag":null,"note_details":[]},{"id":"s0697.06","meeting":33,"doc":"minutes","annex_id":null,"pdf_from":697,"pdf_to":697,"printed_from":687,"ord":5638,"layout":"bilingual","kind":"text","row_type":"pair","fr_html":"<p>M. DE LAPRADELLE se rend à cette invitation. La lecture a lieu dans les mêmes conditions que lors de la séance du matin.</p><p>Cette lecture a été interrompue à 7 heures du soir, pour être continuée à 9 heures le matin suivant.</p>","en_html":"<p>M. DE LAPRADELLE complied. The reading took place as at the morning meeting.</p><p>The reading was adjourned at 7 p.m. until 9 a.m. on the following morning.</p>","full_html":"","fr_text":"M. DE LAPRADELLE se rend à cette invitation. La lecture a lieu dans les mêmes conditions que lors de la séance du matin. Cette lecture a été interrompue à 7 heures du soir, pour être continuée à 9 heures le matin suivant.","en_text":"M. DE LAPRADELLE complied. The reading took place as at the morning meeting. The reading was adjourned at 7 p.m. until 9 a.m. on the following morning.","full_text":"","bbox_fr":[0.0352,0.409,0.4831,0.4995],"bbox_en":[0.4949,0.409,0.9354,0.469],"bbox_full":null,"notes":[],"merged_ids":[],"page_markers":[{"pdf":697,"printed":687}],"text_sha":"21011bcf90068bd07077c6e945bb3623cd1f4003d35209cd7b95fa1d47269753","lang":"both","section":"m33","ord_in_meeting":6,"text_id":null,"parts":[{"pdf":697}],"align_flag":null,"note_details":[]},{"id":"s0697.07","meeting":33,"doc":"minutes","annex_id":null,"pdf_from":697,"pdf_to":697,"printed_from":687,"ord":5639,"layout":"bilingual","kind":"text","row_type":"pair","fr_html":"<p>La séance est levée à 7 heures du soir.</p>","en_html":"<p>The meeting closed at 7 p.m.</p>","full_html":"","fr_text":"La séance est levée à 7 heures du soir.","en_text":"The meeting closed at 7 p.m.","full_text":"","bbox_fr":[0.0573,0.5044,0.4317,0.5202],"bbox_en":[0.514,0.5044,0.793,0.5202],"bbox_full":null,"notes":[],"merged_ids":[],"page_markers":[{"pdf":697,"printed":687}],"text_sha":"2b4169c899a23854b2cec7e4b4b01d93aec2551bb5ead03322d8e1b9ec7e03f6","lang":"both","section":"m33","ord_in_meeting":7,"text_id":null,"parts":[{"pdf":697}],"align_flag":null,"note_details":[]},{"id":"s0697.08","meeting":33,"doc":"minutes","annex_id":null,"pdf_from":697,"pdf_to":697,"printed_from":687,"ord":5640,"layout":"bilingual","kind":"text","row_type":"pair","fr_html":"<p><em>Le Président:</em></p>","en_html":"<p><em>The President:</em></p>","full_html":"","fr_text":"Le Président:","en_text":"The President:","full_text":"","bbox_fr":[0.1777,0.5438,0.3054,0.5595],"bbox_en":[0.6241,0.5438,0.7651,0.5595],"bbox_full":null,"notes":[],"merged_ids":[],"page_markers":[{"pdf":697,"printed":687}],"text_sha":"aec02806179846ed97cc0c275fb467144